# Safety

This repository is public. Do not put internal business details, customer or vendor names, prices, or account identifiers in commits, evidence, or pull requests.

- Never print or store secret values. Keep tokens, keys, passwords, and credential-file bodies out of logs, commits, and pull requests.
- Do not commit customer data, prompts, completions, or private lab captures.
- Never run or dispatch GitHub Actions workflows from an agent task (including `workflow_dispatch`).
- Do not create tags, publish packages, deploy, or trigger Cursor cloud runs as part of this repo's agent work.
- Do not commit credential files or captured sensitive output.
